After re-reading la selpahi's excellent article on plural quantification, I=
=20
became curious how much of a problem there was with collective or=20
non-distributive sumti places.
Does that just come up with jmaji, simxu, and a few others, or is it=20
pervasive?
So I went thru the whole gimste and decided which places seemed=20
non-distributive and found 143, listed in the attachment.
As I think PC pointed out, there were a good number of cases where usage=20
might go either way depending on context.
All the "under conditions" places might qualify, except I don't understand=
=20
the meaning of that, yet.

Any one take a similar look at what places distribute?

mihe la bremenli

